# Demo mode: a whole invented Fabric estate, so the toolkit works with nothing
# connected to it. Loaded by `npm run dev:demo` (vite --mode demo).
#
# This file holds no secret and never should — it is committed on purpose, and
# the repository's .gitignore makes an explicit exception for it. Anything that
# needs a credential does not belong in demo mode at all.
VITE_FABRIC_DEMO=1
